{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人張鈞甯在新劇首度擔任監製，更找來相隔20年再合作的言承旭搭檔，不過意見多多的她竟惹來導演「投訴」，更表示冇下次！</p><p>另外，下月初播放的台版《我們的藍調時光》中，張鈞甯與F4另一成員周渝民（仔仔）首演情侶，要演抑鬱症角色的她表示要找有病患的朋</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:24:26.680066+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T16:01:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T16:17:37.044238+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T16:17:37.044238+00:00","content_hash":"b24941b76f1baa75f1c985b1ca946cbbe0947c07f8cdb4c74551d668924c435e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}